      body: 'Most clinics and all coordinators start on WhatsApp or Instagram. Insist on a video consultation with the named surgeon, not a sales representative, and send your medical history, medications, BMI and photos. Bogotá\'s health secretariat said after the July 2026 death that \'lo barato no es seguro\' and that patients must verify the facility and the professional before anything else.',
