      title: 'Surgery day',
      body: 'Confirm the surgery happens at the REPS-listed site, with an anesthesiologist present and an overnight stay for body contouring. In the 2025 Cali death of Alicia Stone the clinic was later closed temporarily for a staffing deficiency; in the 2021 Medellín death of a New York resident the patient removed his own drains in a hotel. Ask who monitors you the first night and where.',
