      body: 'US citizens enter visa-free for tourism for up to 90 days at the immigration officer\'s discretion, extendable through Migración Colombia up to 180 days in any 12-month period. Carry a passport valid for your stay (Colombian immigration recommends six months beyond departure) and proof of an onward or return ticket. Migración Colombia\'s CheckMig online pre-registration can be completed from 72 hours to one hour before each flight in and out; the UK government describes it as optional but it speeds entry and airlines may ask for the confirmation. Yellow-fever certificates are required only if arriving from certain countries. Expect a spot interview; say truthfully that you are coming for medical treatment and bring your clinic appointment letter.',
